Smart Home Automation System Links Devices Based on Rules. A Rule Has Triggers, Optional Conditions, and Actions. Rules Must Have Priorities to Resolve Conflicts: The 'Movie Mode' Scene (Sets Lights to 10%) Must Block the 'Morning' Scene (Sets Lights to 100%) from Running. Safety Constraints Are Critical: The 'Smart Oven' Action Is Disabled If 'Home Status' Is 'Away'. Also, The 'Air Conditioner' Action Is Dynamically Disabled If Any 'Window Sensor' Reports 'Open' and Only Re-enables 5 Minutes After All Windows Are Closed.